  "notes": "Released as a preview together with DeepSeek-V4-Flash; the card and report call it the preview version of the DeepSeek-V4 series, the 0731 and 0813 cards call it DeepSeek-V4-Pro (Preview) and the change log V4-Pro-Preview. At launch the web chat offered V4 via Expert Mode and Instant Mode; which model serves which mode is not stated. The DeepSeek-V4-Pro-DSpark repository on Hugging Face is not a new model: its card says it is the same checkpoint with a speculative decoding module attached. The V4 model card PDF and the arXiv report (v1 submitted 2026-04-26) cover both V4 models."
